    {
      "name": "sugon-tokens",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "曙光云品牌令牌 tokens.css",
      "description": "Sugon Cloud brand design tokens as plain CSS variables: brand red #C8161D, gray/white neutrals, type scale, radius, spacing, shadows and button sizes. Writes src/styles/sugon-tokens.css.",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "skills/sugon-brand-kit/tokens.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "~/src/styles/sugon-tokens.css"
        }
      ],
      "css": {
        "@import \"./styles/sugon-tokens.css\"": {}
      },
      "docs": "已写入 src/styles/sugon-tokens.css。若上面的日志有 Updating 你的入口 CSS（components.json 里 tailwind.css 指向的文件，Vite 为 src/index.css），@import \"./styles/sugon-tokens.css\"; 已经写进去，不必再手改。若没有这行 Updating，说明项目没有 components.json（例如刚 npm create vite），请在 src/index.css 最顶部手写这一行：@import \"./styles/sugon-tokens.css\";。路径相对于入口 CSS 所在目录；入口不在 src/（例如 app/globals.css）时改成正确的相对路径。用 Tailwind v4 时，这行放在 @import \"tailwindcss\" 之前。"
    },
    {
      "name": "sugon-theme",
      "type": "registry:theme",
      "title": "曙光云 shadcn 主题（标准变量）",
      "description": "Sugon Cloud theme for projects that already use shadcn/ui: sets the standard shadcn tokens (background, foreground, card, popover, primary, secondary, muted, accent, destructive, border, input, ring, radius, sidebar-*) in :root. Primary/ring = brand red #C8161D; accent (hover surface) = neutral #f4f4f5; radius-* derived from --radius. Light only. Needs components.json, tsconfig.json or jsconfig.json, and a non-empty entry CSS (the shadcn CLI crashes on an empty file). Does not write skill files; pair with sugon-brand-kit for the Agent Skill and sugon-* classes.",
      "cssVars": {
        "theme": {
          "radius-sm": "calc(var(--radius) * 0.6)",
          "radius-md": "calc(var(--radius) * 0.8)",
          "radius-lg": "var(--radius)",
          "radius-xl": "calc(var(--radius) * 1.4)",
          "radius-2xl": "calc(var(--radius) * 1.8)",
          "radius-3xl": "calc(var(--radius) * 2.2)",
          "radius-4xl": "calc(var(--radius) * 2.6)"
        },
        "light": {
          "radius": "0.75rem",
          "background": "#ffffff",
          "foreground": "#171717",
          "card": "#ffffff",
          "card-foreground": "#171717",
          "popover": "#ffffff",
          "popover-foreground": "#171717",
          "primary": "#C8161D",
          "primary-foreground": "#ffffff",
          "secondary": "#f4f4f5",
          "secondary-foreground": "#171717",
          "muted": "#f4f4f5",
          "muted-foreground": "#525252",
          "accent": "#f4f4f5",
          "accent-foreground": "#171717",
          "destructive": "#B91C1C",
          "border": "#e5e5e5",
          "input": "#d4d4d4",
          "ring": "#C8161D",
          "sidebar": "#fafafa",
          "sidebar-foreground": "#171717",
          "sidebar-primary": "#C8161D",
          "sidebar-primary-foreground": "#ffffff",
          "sidebar-accent": "#f4f4f5",
          "sidebar-accent-foreground": "#171717",
          "sidebar-border": "#e5e5e5",
          "sidebar-ring": "#C8161D"
        }
      },
      "docs": "已把曙光品牌映射到 shadcn 标准变量（写在入口 CSS 的 :root）：primary / ring = 曙光红 #C8161D，accent（悬停底）= 中性灰 #f4f4f5，background / card / popover = 白，border / input = 灰，radius = 0.75rem，radius-sm…4xl 由 --radius 推导。只覆盖亮色；.dark 保持你项目原值。本条目不拷贝 tokens.css / components.css / SKILL.md；需要 AI 技能与 sugon-* 类时再装 sugon-brand-kit。若安装报 Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'proxyOf')：入口 CSS 是空文件，先写入 @import \"tailwindcss\"; 再装。若报 Couldn't find tsconfig.json：项目根目录需要 tsconfig.json 或 jsconfig.json（shadcn init 会生成）。"
    },
